 surged by impressive 33% to INR4,122 crore, thereby achieving 94% EBITDA margin.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Grid curtailment currently reduces overall EBITDA by 5% to 7%.","quote":"However, in the current scenario, as was the trend in the past, a curtailment has an impact of in the range of 5% to 7% on our overall EBITDA as we speak.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects curtailment from Khavda to be resolved by the end of the calendar year.","quote":"And, by the end of this calendar year, our expectation is that there should not be any curtailment, at least from Khavda, for all the capacities which we have installed.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company guided for FY27 capital expenditure of approximately INR 42,000 crore to add 5 GW of renewable energy capacity.","quote":"So, see from a Capex perspective, the FY '27 guidance is about INR42,000 crores of Capex to be done for FY '27 because we are looking at about 5 GW of expansion in RE","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Run-rate EBITDA is expected to reach approximately INR 21,000 crore by the end of FY27 compared to INR 17,000 crore currently.","quote":"So, our current run-rate EBITDA for the operational portfolio is about INR17,000 crore. For the expected for the FY '27, it is about INR21,000 crore.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"National electricity demand continues to expand in line with India's GDP growth.","quote":"Sorry, I think it is, if you look at India's energy demand, especially the electricity demand, that's been growing, it is in line with our GDP growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Infirm merchant power realizations including RECs are currently averaging around INR 2.5 per unit.","quote":"Yes. I think, Shirom, the current is in line with what the merchant power is selling through, including the RECs. It varies, but it is in the range of INR2.5 per unit.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"EBITDA from power supply reached a 94% margin during the quarter.","quote":"And EBITDA from power supply surged by impressive 33% to INR4,122 crore, thereby achieving 94% EBITDA margin.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"First-quarter capital expenditure grew 41% year-on-year to INR 8,800 crore.","quote":"Our CapEx of INR8,800 crores during the quarter increased by 41% Y-o-Y, highlighting the efficient capital deployment with every passing quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Adani Green commissioned 1.9 GW of battery energy storage capacity at Khavda during the quarter, taking total installed capacity to 3.5 GW-hour.","quote":"We commissioned 1.9 GW of battery energy storage capacity at Khavda during the quarter, taking total installed capacity to 3.5 GW-hour.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company has contracted capacity with Adani Energy Limited on an arm's length basis to de-risk merchant exposure.","quote":"In order to de-risk ourself and concentrate more on the project execution and operational excellence, on a long-term basis, we have contracted on an arm's length basis and with new approval of the Board on arm's length transaction","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"India achieved 283 GW of installed non-fossil capacity, surpassing half of cumulative capacity ahead of the 2030 target.","quote":"The country reached 283 GW of installed non-fossil capacity, achieving over 50% of India's cumulative capacity ahead of its 2030 target. This demonstrates the strength of the green energy ecosystem and policy support.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The high energy density of LFP batteries creates operational risks that require strict adherence to safety protocols.","quote":"Yes. You are right. The energy density of LFP is so high that you are packing in a lot of energy in the 20-foot container. So, you have to maintain a lot of safety protocols.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Adani Green Energy is firmly poised to reliably meet growing clean energy needs while delivering industry-leading operational performance.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ADANIGREEN_27072026150703_Letter.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracte